/*
  QuietHoursPanel.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0210 · QuietHoursPanel (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  QuietHoursPanel resolves (table "QuietHoursPanel") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first groups are the exact keys extracted from the web source
  (features/settings/components/QuietHoursPanel.tsx, including the `toast.quietHours.*`
  and `quietHours.error.*` keys). The remainder back the native state envelope
  (freshness chip, connectivity banner, error retry, toast dismiss) and the localized
  next-change schedule labels (the web hard-coded those literals; the native port routes
  them through the catalog).
*/

